    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A bit of information</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.poster.avif?t=1746466104\" width=580 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.webm?t=1746466104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rat, what's the game about? Please tell us</strong></i><br><i></i><br><i>Duster Buster is a <strong>Pixel-art rogue-lite</strong> adventure blending <strong>horror and humor</strong>.\u00a0Players take on the role as a cleaner hired to clean a big, run-down mansion filled with furniture-monsters.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game\u2019s quirky take on both combat, character-building, and cleaning, along with a lighthearted story, makes it approachable for casual players interested in a fun experience with a sometimes hardcore genre, while still somewhat challenging for advanced fans of the genre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player unravels the secrets of the <strong>mansion</strong>, guided by their <strong>mole-merchant sidekick</strong>, they get to choose a build that works for them, adding a layer of replayability.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.poster.avif?t=1746466104\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.apng?t=1746466104\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=214 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can we do?</strong></i><br><br>RunLight attack<br>Heavy attack<br>Dodge / Dash<br>Clean corpses<br>Upgrade<br>Speaking (Dialogue System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A bit of information</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.poster.avif?t=1746466104\" width=580 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.webm?t=1746466104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rat, what's the game about? Please tell us</strong></i><br><i></i><br><i>Duster Buster is a <strong>Pixel-art rogue-lite</strong> adventure blending <strong>horror and humor</strong>.\u00a0Players take on the role as a cleaner hired to clean a big, run-down mansion filled with furniture-monsters.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game\u2019s quirky take on both combat, character-building, and cleaning, along with a lighthearted story, makes it approachable for casual players interested in a fun experience with a sometimes hardcore genre, while still somewhat challenging for advanced fans of the genre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player unravels the secrets of the <strong>mansion</strong>, guided by their <strong>mole-merchant sidekick</strong>, they get to choose a build that works for them, adding a layer of replayability.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.poster.avif?t=1746466104\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.apng?t=1746466104\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=214 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can we do?</strong></i><br><br>RunLight attack<br>Heavy attack<br>Dodge / Dash<br>Clean corpses<br>Upgrade<br>Speaking (Dialogue System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
